# PETAL PARADE: a sun circle moves on after about 10 seconds. If nobody was
# saved on it, Madame Nettle plants a toadstool; from 100 saved she plants
# 2, from 150 saved 3. A circle that was used moves on without her.
game petalparade
wait 20
press A
cheat clear
cheat put pup 5 7
cheat put pad 5 7
cheat put pad 5 6
cheat put pad 5 5
cheat startime 60
wait 26
expect line == 1
press B
expect saved == 1
expect star_used == 1
wait 40
expect toadstools == 0
expect star_t > 590
expect pads >= 9
cheat still
cheat startime 30
wait 30
expect toadstools == 1
expect star_t == 600
cheat saved 100
cheat startime 5
wait 6
expect toadstools == 3
cheat saved 150
cheat startime 5
wait 6
expect toadstools == 6
